  "description": "A MongoDB repository for .NET: CRUD, partial updates, projections, streaming reads, bulk writes, retrying transactions and declarative index management. Shares a single pooled MongoClient, honours CancellationToken end to end, and creates indexes once at startup instead of once per request.",
